        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.755,
            0.67,
            0.873,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Threads of Curiosity"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.704,
            0.717,
            0.888,
            0.903
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "While walking, your arms and legs move in a complex manner. Yet your overall motion can be studied by treating your body as a single object. Science often becomes simpler when we stop looking at parts and start looking at the whole."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
